  "design": {
    "decision": "Bid 4 or less with a team that could bid more, often pairing a nil with a modest partner bid.",
    "opponent": "Revealed on the bid; opponents know the team bid small and can try to bust a nil.",
    "rationale": "It gives Nil and Exact a ×multiplier tied to the bid size. It pulls against Bid High on purpose, so it is a real bidding choice, and since overtricks score nothing, underbidding still costs points.",
